<title>USA: US Mint buys 1,536,000 kg copper at avg $2.5657/kg.</title>
<headline>US Mint buys 1,536,000 kg copper at avg $2.5657/kg.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Mint said Wednesday that it bought a total of 1,536,000 kg of copper from three firms at an average price of $2.5657 per kg.</p>
<p>It bought 1,472,000 kg of copper from Ore &amp; Chemical Co for $2.5647 per kg and 45,856 kg from Cerro Sales Corp at $2.5849 per kg.</p>
<p>It said it purchased the final 18,144 kg of copper from Kataman Metals Inc for $2.6006 per kg.</p>
